{"id":"wb-7-212","name":"银山银矿遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"银山银矿遗址","text":"银山银矿遗址位于中国江西省上饶市德兴市银山矿区，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n银山银矿遗址占地5.67平方千米，从唐朝至今，开采时间长达1300多年，现存古银矿采冶矿井遗址188处，是目前中国发现的面积最大、矿井数量最多、矿井形制最为复杂的大型银矿矿冶遗址，也是目前所见中国最早的银矿矿冶遗址之一。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%93%B6%E5%B1%B1%E9%93%B6%E7%9F%BF%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":86761193,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86761193","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ab2cbdcfdab7d04198dfc922.jpg","title":"Dexing Yinshan Yinkuang Yizhi 2018.07.04 16-52-15.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dexing_Yinshan_Yinkuang_Yizhi_2018.07.04_16-52-15.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/Dexing_Yinshan_Yinkuang_Yizhi_2018.07.04_16-52-15.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"银山银矿遗址","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata P373 专属相册：Silver Mine Relics in Yinshan","categorySourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Silver_Mine_Relics_in_Yinshan"}}